From: epp-v2
Subject: [PATCH] tools/libxl: treat an unset b_info.tpm as no TPM

libxl__need_xenpv_qemu() asserted on b_info.tpm, which is left at its
default in the stub domain config init-dom0less writes for dom0less
domains, so every "xl block-attach" / "xl network-attach" to a dom0less
domain aborted with "libxl_defbool_val: Assertion
`!libxl_defbool_is_default(db)' failed".

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
--- a/tools/libs/light/libxl_dm.c
+++ b/tools/libs/light/libxl_dm.c
@@ -3861,7 +3861,9 @@
      * Here also check for emulated TPM: if enabled xenpv QEMU is
      * needed.
      */
-    if (d_config->num_vfbs > 0 || libxl_defbool_val(d_config->b_info.tpm)) {
+    if (d_config->num_vfbs > 0 ||
+        (!libxl_defbool_is_default(d_config->b_info.tpm) &&
+         libxl_defbool_val(d_config->b_info.tpm))) {
         ret = 1;
         goto out;
     }
